OL,3,GNEWSAHotel staff to strike during Pride
OL,4,Aweekend event
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a Manchester hotel will be on
OL,7,Fstrike during the city's upcoming Pride
OL,8,Fweekend.
OL,10,FUnite union members working at the
OL,11,FKimpton Clocktower hotel and its bar,
OL,12,FThe Refuge, will be striking over
OL,13,Fworking conditions on Saturday - the
OL,14,Fsecond day of Manchester Pride.
OL,16,FThe strike will mark the first ever
OL,17,Fhospitality strike in the North West,
OL,18,Faccording to the union. It comes after
OL,19,Fthe hotel advertised Pride weekend
OL,20,Fpackage stays and a free two-day Pride
OL,21,Fcelebration to take place at the
OL,22,Fhotel's Refuge bar.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
