OL,3,GNEWSAHotel staff to strike during Pride
OL,4,Aweekend event
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for InterContinental
OL,7,FHotels Group UK (IHG), which owns the
OL,8,FKimpton Clocktower, said it has plans
OL,9,Fto minimise disruption - adding "the
OL,10,Fhotel and The Refuge continue to
OL,11,Foperate as normal".
